    "호화로운 방으로 들어서자, 닉스는 억지 미소를 띠고 고개를 숙인 채 내 옆에 바짝 붙어 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:272
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_168e941c:

    # "Lingering around the place were a couple guards who I presumed were Khazahs, and upon noticing me entering, one of those guards approached."
    "그 장소 주변에는 카자로 추정되는 경비병 몇몇이 서성이고 있었고, 내가 들어서는 것을 알아채고 그 중 한 명이 다가왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:275
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_45e957f2:

    # GUARD "What business have you here?"
    GUARD"여긴 무슨 일로 왔나?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:276
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_b5c7e919:

    # MC @ serious "I am here to speak to Angharad."
    MC @ serious "안가라드와 이야기하러 왔소."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:277
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_7e7dd46e:

    # GUARD "There is no-"
    GUARD"그런 건 없-"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:278
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_6ed1ca96:

    # "A voice called from one of the conjoined rooms."
    "연결된 방 중 하나에서 목소리가 들려왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:279
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_8d26892c:

    # ANGHARAD "Hold!"
    ANGHARAD"멈춰라!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:283
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_4f873ab1:

    # "Emerging from the other room, a tall, imposing man who dragged in a chained girl crawling pitifully behind him."
    "다른 방에서, 사슬에 묶인 소녀를 불쌍하게 기어서 끌고 오는 키 크고 위압적인 남자가 나타났다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:284
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_d2204527:

    # "The muscular man smiled and beamed pridefully, and while the attire he wore was not expensive garbs by any means, it was clear he lived well."
    "근육질의 남자는 자랑스럽게 미소 지으며 활짝 웃었다. 그가 입은 복장이 결코 비싼 옷은 아니었지만, 그가 잘 살고 있다는 것은 분명했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:285
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_e4d0a317:

    # "The girl in contrast, had only a doll like look to her eyes, it seemed like she was only half here in the moment with us."
    "대조적으로, 그 소녀의 눈은 인형 같은 표정뿐이었고, 그 순간 우리와 반쯤만 함께 있는 것처럼 보였다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:286
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_f193cbf7:

    # "Her cheeks were puffy, and it seemed like she had been crying recently, but she refused to look up away from the floor for me to get a good look to know for sure."
    "그녀의 볼은 부어 있었고, 최근에 울었던 것처럼 보였지만, 확실히 알 수 있도록 자세히 보려 해도 그녀는 바닥에서 눈을 떼려 하지 않았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:287
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_412b0a33:

    # "While she didn't look starved or have any visible bruises on her, it was clear this caged bird was broken, her wings clipped."
    "굶주려 보이거나 눈에 보이는 멍이 있지는 않았지만, 이 갇힌 새는 부러져 있고, 날개가 꺾여 있다는 것이 분명했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:288
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_727f4bad:

    # "The man run his hand through his groomed beard as he stepped towards us, dragging the poor girl in heel."
    "남자는 손질된 수염 사이로 손을 쓸어내리며 우리 쪽으로 다가왔고, 불쌍한 소녀를 발뒤꿈치로 끌고 왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:290
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_d941b4eb:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "Ahh ... Finally we meet."
    ANGHARAD @ smile "아... 드디어 만났군."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:293
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_86b2da5a:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "{i}Friend?{/i}"
    ANGHARAD @ smile "{i}친구?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:294
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_3e812649:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "Well, here is to hoping there is a long and fruitful partnership on the horizon."
    ANGHARAD @ smile "음, 길고 유익한 파트너십이 지평선에 있기를 기대하며."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:297
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_e44d1954:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "Haha ... Straight to business already?"
    ANGHARAD @ smile "하하... 벌써 바로 본론인가?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:298
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_9875e6cc:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "Relax, business soon."
    ANGHARAD @ smile "진정하시오, 사업은 곧."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:301
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_0b32bb10:

    # "Angharad looked down at the slave girl grovelling at his feet."
    "안가라드가 그의 발치에 엎드린 노예 소녀를 내려다보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:303
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_33360273:

    # ANGHARAD @ think "Alysha, fetch me and my guest some wine."
    ANGHARAD @ think "알리샤, 나와 내 손님에게 와인을 가져와라."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:304
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_f2849e25:

    # "The slave girl Alysha nodded, and rose to her feet to go pour some wine into cups for us."
    "노예 소녀 알리샤가 고개를 끄덕이고, 일어서서 우리를 위해 잔에 와인을 따르러 갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:316
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_7c04682d:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "Alysha is my {i}private{/i} slave."
    ANGHARAD @ smile "알리샤는 내 {i}개인{/i} 노예요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:317
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_62a2e341:

    # "Angharad's eyes lustfully looked over at Nyx."
    "안가라드의 눈이 음탕하게 닉스를 훑어보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:319
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_d73ab651:

    # ANGHARAD @ lewd "{i}And this lovely creature is ...?{/i}"
    ANGHARAD @ lewd "{i}그리고 이 사랑스러운 존재는 ...?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:320
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_90599dfe:

    # MC @ talk "This is ..."
    MC @ talk "이쪽은 ..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:321
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_f4808e53:

    # "I hesitated for a brief moment, and Captain Nyx nervously looked towards me."
    "나는 잠시 망설였고, 닉스 대장이 긴장된 표정으로 나를 바라보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:322
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_50e584a4:

    # MC @ talk "Lyesha."
    MC @ talk "리에샤."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:323
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_491f2370:

    # ANGHARAD @ think "Lyesha ..."
    ANGHARAD @ think "리에샤 ..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:324
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_157fced7:

    # "Angharad let the tongue roll off his name."
    "안가라드가 그 이름을 혀에서 굴렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:325
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_c9ee1293:

    # ANGHARAD @ lewd "Ly-esh-a..."
    ANGHARAD @ lewd "리-에-샤..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:326
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_c391572a:

    # ANGHARAD @ think "Quite the unusual name."
    ANGHARAD @ think "꽤 특이한 이름이군."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:327
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_0c7a4ec5:

    # "Captain Nyx didn't say anything, but her whole body seemed to stiffen up to his words."
    "닉스 대장은 아무 말도 하지 않았지만, 그의 말에 온몸이 굳어지는 것 같았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:328
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_d1c3f431:

    # "Nyx continued to smile and say nothing as he hungrily looked at her from the other side of the room, but I could sense her shiver in both revulsion and unease."
    "닉스는 그가 방 저편에서 그녀를 탐욕스럽게 바라보는 동안 계속 미소 지으며 아무 말도 하지 않았지만, 나는 그녀가 혐오감과 불안감에 몸서리치는 것을 느낄 수 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:329
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_555c8a24:

    # ANGHARAD @ lewd "What does she look like from behind?"
    ANGHARAD @ lewd "뒤에서 보면 어떤가?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:331
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_09d1bb34:

    # "Nyx's eyes met mine."
    "닉스의 눈이 내 눈과 마주쳤다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:332
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_1d8633eb:

    # MC @ talk "Turn around and show him slave."
    MC @ talk "돌아서서 보여줘라 노예야."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:337
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_ffd2d3ca:

    # "Nyx obediently did as she was told."
    "닉스가 순종적으로 시키는 대로 했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:338
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_82efe494:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "Very nice ... And where did this one come from?"
    ANGHARAD @ smile "아주 좋군... 그리고 이 녀석은 어디서 왔소?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:344
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_bf2bcfd1:

    # MC @ serious "She's told me she came from Gerano before it fell, I found her in one of the passing villages begging."
    MC @ serious "그녀가 제라노가 함락되기 전에 거기서 왔다고 말했소. 지나가는 마을 중 하나에서 구걸하는 그녀를 찾았소."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:345
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_7ef6d285:

    # "Angharad seemed to be pondering my answer for some time, without saying another word, and quickly, the room felt uneasily tense."
    "안가라드는 한동안 내 대답을 곱씹는 듯했다. 아무 말도 하지 않자, 방 안은 금세 불편할 정도로 긴장감이 감돌았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:346
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_6372230f:

    # MC @ smile2 "I have so many slaves these days, I must admit, it becomes hard to remember all their names sometimes."
    MC @ smile2 "요즘 노예가 너무 많아서, 인정하건대, 가끔은 그들의 이름을 다 기억하기 어려울 때가 있소."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:347
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_854ded05:

    # MC @ smile "But Lyesha here, she's a faithful servant to me."
    MC @ smile "하지만 여기 리에샤는, 나에게 충실한 하인이오."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:348
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_94d974dd:

    # ANGHARAD @ think "..."
    ANGHARAD@ think "..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:349
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_0e687690:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "Hahaha, now that is something I can understand!"
    ANGHARAD @ smile "하하하, 그거야말로 내가 이해할 수 있는 거군!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:350
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_97022025:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "I used to try remembering names, but in the end, I decided it was simply easier to brand the product."
    ANGHARAD @ smile "나도 이름을 기억하려고 노력했지만, 결국 상품에 낙인을 찍는 게 더 간단하다고 결정했소."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:351
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_78ec077f:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "Much simpler that way."
    ANGHARAD @ smile "그게 훨씬 간단하오."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:352
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_181239d4:

    # "Captain Nyx's hand balled up into a fist, but she did her best to remain submissively bowed with that same strained smile on her face."
    "닉스 대장의 손이 주먹을 쥐었지만, 그녀는 그 똑같은 긴장된 미소를 얼굴에 띤 채 복종적으로 고개 숙이고 있기 위해 최선을 다했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:354
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_0524b7dd:

    # "The slave girl Alysha returned with cups of wine on a tray, and Angharad snatched one, which he gulped at before slapping Alysha's ass loudly."
    "노예 소녀 알리샤가 쟁반에 와인 잔을 담아 돌아왔고, 안가라드가 하나를 낚아채서 들이켠 후 알리샤의 엉덩이를 세게 때렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:357
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_7bb83798:

    # ALYSHA @ shock "{i}*Gasp!*{/i}"
    ALYSHA @ shock "{i}*헉!*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:358
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_09f5856f:

    # "Alysha spilled half of the other cup for me as she stumbled forward towards me."
    "알리샤가 나를 향해 비틀거리며 앞으로 넘어지면서 나를 위한 다른 잔의 절반을 쏟았다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:360
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_c5c20aa7:

    # ALYSHA @ sad "I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!"
    ALYSHA @ sad "죄송합니다! 정말 죄송합니다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:361
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_7484d763:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "Now look what you've done girl! Can't even hand someone a drink without fucking it up."
    ANGHARAD @ talk "이게 무슨 짓이냐! 누구에게 술 한잔 건네는 것조차 제대로 못 하다니."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:362
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_fdbdf276:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "Should I fetch the coals again?"
    ANGHARAD @ talk "다시 숯을 가져올까?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:363
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_72540a38:

    # ALYSHA @ shock "P-Please no."
    ALYSHA @ shock "제-제발 안 돼요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:364
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_e4287227:

    # MC @ talk "There's no harm, don't worry."
    MC @ talk "아무 해 없어, 걱정 마."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:365
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_14ec0ef4:

    # "Gently, I took the half-empty cup and began to sip from it."
    "부드럽게, 나는 반쯤 빈 잔을 받아 홀짝이기 시작했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:366
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_acbc431b:

    # MC @ smile "Thank you, Alysha."
    MC @ smile "고마워, 알리샤."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:368
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_60585fce:

    # "For a brief moment, some light seemed to return to Alysha's eyes before Angharad snapped."
    "잠시 동안, 안가라드가 소리치기 전에 알리샤의 눈에 약간의 빛이 돌아오는 듯했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:370
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_a1b7cd4a:

    # ANGHARAD @ talk "Don't go too soft on your slaves, they start getting all the wrong ideas."
    ANGHARAD @ talk "노예들에게 너무 부드럽게 대하지 마시오, 잘못된 생각을 품기 시작하니까."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:381
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_4eea5227:

    # "Angharad moved over to the comfort of one of the seats and snapped his fingers, Alysha, with that returning blank look in her eyes moved over to kneel down obediently beside him."
    "안가라드가 좌석 중 하나의 안락함으로 이동해 손가락을 튕기자, 알리샤는 눈에 다시 멍한 표정을 띠며 순종적으로 그의 옆에 무릎 꿇으러 갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:382
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_6107efb5:

    # ANGHARAD @ smile "Come then ... Before we discuss {i}this thing of ours,{/i} tell me more about you."
    ANGHARAD @ smile "자 그럼... 우리의 {i}이 일{/i}을 논하기 전에, 당신에 대해 더 말해주시오."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:383
translate kr qsttheslavemaster_meeting_80623b65:

