translate kr strings:

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:51
    old "I know nothing about being a slave master, how will I even convince him?"
    new "노예상이 뭔지도 모르는데, 어떻게 그자를 설득하겠어?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:58
    old "Why can't you just arrest him upon arrival?"
    new "도착하면 그냥 체포하면 안 되는 거야?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:66
    old "I see."
    new "그렇군."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:69
    old "Are there not dozens of slave masters doing the same? Why is he so important?"
    new "똑같은 짓 하는 노예상이 수십 명은 있을 텐데, 왜 그자가 그렇게 중요한 거지?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:77
    old "I think I've got the idea."
    new "대충 감은 잡았어."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:80
    old "What's in it for me first?"
    new "먼저 나한테 돌아오는 건 뭔데?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:85
    old "Coin of course."
    new "물론 돈이지."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:88
    old "Make it seven-fifty and we're talking."
    new "750으로 올려주면 얘기해 보자고."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:94
    old "I could do with some more useful equipment."
    new "좀 더 쓸모 있는 장비가 있으면 좋겠군."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:99
    old "That'll do."
    new "그거면 됐어."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:103
    old "I'll take your panties."
    new "네 팬티를 받겠어."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:107
    old "(I probably shouldn't push my luck on this one.)"
    new "(이번 건에서 운을 너무 시험하면 안 되겠지.)"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:110
    old "Do I sound like I'm {i}not{/i} serious?"
    new "내가 진지하게{i} 안{/i} 들려?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:198
    old "There's something I can do that might help!"
    new "내가 도움이 될 만한 일을 할 수 있을 거야!"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:203
    old "Why not fill in the role yourself?"
    new "네가 직접 그 역할을 맡으면 되잖아?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:244
    old "You look amazing!"
    new "정말 멋져 보여!"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:256
    old "I am; Let's begin."
    new "좋아. 시작하자."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:292
    old "Likewise, friend."
    new "나도 마찬가지야, 친구."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:296
    old "Shall we discuss business?"
    new "사업 얘기나 해볼까?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:395
    old "The King's high Road."
    new "왕의 대로."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:398
    old "The Revalian back roads."
    new "레발리아 뒷길."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:400
    old "By boat along the river streams."
    new "강줄기를 따라 배로."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:415
    old "One to two-thousand Alderian coins."
    new "알데리아 주화 천에서 이천 닢."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:417
    old "Three to five-thousand Alderian coins"
    new "알데리아 주화 삼천에서 오천 닢"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:420
    old "Five to seven-thousand Alderian coins."
    new "알데리아 주화 오천에서 칠천 닢."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:427
    old "What's with all the questions?"
    new "질문이 왜 이리 많지?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:432
    old "The King's High Road."
    new "왕의 대로."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:434
    old "By boat along the river streams"
    new "강줄기를 따라 배로"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:436
    old "The Karisan routes."
    new "카리산 루트."

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:826
    old "Why didn't you free the others afterwards?"
    new "왜 그 후에 다른 사람들은 풀어주지 않은 거야?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheSlavemaster/qst_TheSlavemaster_scr.rpy:837
    old "I can respect that."
    new "그건 존중할 수 있지."

